<title>SOUTH KOREA: Workers break picket lines at S.Korea's Hyundai.</title>
<headline>Workers break picket lines at S.Korea's Hyundai.</headline>
<dateline>ULSAN, South Korea 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Several hundred non-union workers broke through picket lines at South Korea's Hyundai Heavy Industries on Wednesday in defiance of a strike billed as the biggest in history, witnesses said.</p>
<p>They said the workers scuffled briefly with about 300 unionists who had blocked the entrance to South Korea's largest shipyard, which was now operating normally.</p>
</text>
